      "changeId": "change-verification-generalization-and-lean-run-normalization",
      "scope": "E2 Proposal mutation scope correction after failed 20260814-146-apply; architecture and all approved E2 semantics remain unchanged.",
      "requiredOutcomes": [
        "Add tests/unit/services/a1-write-service.test.ts as an exact allowed selector under both apply and revise-apply flowkitMutationScope, because E2 insertion changes the canonical Delivery Change count from 9 to 10 and repository all-green acceptance requires updating that regression.",
        "After the minimal Proposal/Design scope correction, create a new Proposal generation for Reviewer re-approval before any Apply retry.",
        "Do not add any other mutation selector or implementation scope unless independently required by a new formal fact.",
        "Preserve the approved E2 architecture and all Proposal/Design/OpenSpec semantics from the 142/144 generation; do not reopen 136 Explore or redesign generic Verification, historical E1 compatibility, three-file prospective Run, crash/recovery, or next-consumer boundaries.",
        "Supersede the Proposal/apply generation that culminated in failed 20260814-146-apply only as needed to correct the approved mutation declaration."
      ],
